---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="contact" class="contact-section">
  <div class="contact-map" aria-hidden="true"><div></div><span>✧</span></div>
  <div class="container contact-inner reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span>05</span> LA PROCHAINE AVENTURE</p>
    <div class="contact-availability"><span class="status-dot"></span> Disponible pour de nouvelles collaborations</div>
    <h2>Et si on prenait<br /><em>le large ensemble ?</em></h2>
    <p>Une idée, un défi, un projet ambitieux ?<br />Tout commence par une conversation.</p>
    <a class="button button-gold" href="mailto:syraxrakotonarivo@gmail.com">Parlons de votre projet <Icon name="diagonal" /></a>
    <div class="contact-email"><a href="mailto:syraxrakotonarivo@gmail.com">syraxrakotonarivo@gmail.com</a><button id="copy-email" aria-label="Copier l’adresse e-mail"><Icon name="copy" /></button></div>
    <p id="copy-status" class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div class="contact-links"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rakotonarivo-sandratra-72b24a173" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <Icon name="diagonal" /></a><span>·</span><a href="tel:+261348406161">+261 34 840 6161 <Icon name="diagonal" /></a><span>·</span><span>Antananarivo, Madagascar</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-inner"><a href="#hero" class="footer-brand">SANDRATRA<span>.</span></a><p>Fait avec passion, et un esprit de nakama.</p><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Sandratra</span><a href="#hero" class="back-top" aria-label="Retour en haut">↑</a></div></footer>
